 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "BookingSystem(properties) receives rows [id, neighborhood, capacity] of strings (capacity a decimal integer). book(neighborhood, groupSize) considers the properties of that neighborhood that are not yet booked and picks a set whose total capacity is at least groupSize, by these rules in order: fewest properties; then smallest total capacity; then the lexicographically smallest list of ids sorted in code-point order. The chosen properties become booked for every later call. Return the chosen ids sorted in code-point order, or [] (booking nothing) when no set is large enough.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
